summary: beaker library for Firmware Test Suite (fwts)
description: |
    This is meant to be a library for other tasks that want to use
    fwts. It provides setup, beaker reporting and cleanup functions.

    For more info see the internal QE wiki page for fwts.
contact: Oliver Gutierrez <ogutierr@redhat.com>
component:
  - firmware
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
require:
  - beakerlib
  - iasl
  - wget
  - acpidump
  - pciutils
  - sendmail
  - pcre-devel
  - json-c-devel
  - git
  - elfutils-libelf-devel
  - glib2-devel
  - patch
  - autoconf
  - automake
  - gcc
  - libtool
  - bison
  - flex
recommend:
  - beakerlib-redhat
  - dmidecode
duration: 60m
extra-summary: /kernel/firmware/fwts/include
extra-task: /kernel/firmware/fwts/include
